menu "components/driver"

config NEON_MDF_DRIVER_UART
    bool "Compile UART drivers"
    default y
    help
        HAL UART polling, FIFO and interrupt-control notifications in build. GT32U2086: Enable UART while
        compiling printf/vprintf/puts/putchar and syscall hook _write, no separate printf flag is
        required. The console initializes UART0 on the first export. Disabling option will remove
        the UART driver and GT32U2086 console from the build; calling those APIs will report link errors.

config NEON_MDF_DRIVER_I2C
    bool "Compile I2C driver (i2c/neon_i2c_gt32u2086.c)"
    default y
    help
        HAL I2C GT32U2086: master/slave polling and interrupt, address 7/10
        bit, memory-read repeated START, FIFO, SMBus/PEC, DMA request,
        bus-clear, CRM management and self-configuration SDA/SCL. Timing using period number i2c_clk; board
        must have external pull-up resistors on both SDA and SCL.

config NEON_MDF_DRIVER_CRC
    bool "Compile CRC-8 driver (crc/neon_crc_gt32u2086.c)"
    default y
    help
        Includes CRC-8 driver (NEON_CRC_Calculate) - real port from src_gt32u2086/gt32u2086_crc.c. Disabled to reduce
        Flash usage if the app is not in use.

config NEON_MDF_DRIVER_EFUSE
    bool
    default n
    help
        Old sdkconfig compatible symbol; OTP source kept at driver/efuse. GT32U2086 ROM v5 save security policy
        and public key in Flash NVR; use Flash driver's NVR API, not old OTP address.

config NEON_MDF_DRIVER_ADC
    bool "Compile ADC driver (adc/neon_adc_gt32u2086.c)"
    default y
    help
        GT32U2086 ADC: 12-bit sample slots, configuration channel/timing and polling.

config NEON_MDF_DRIVER_DMA
    bool "Compile DMA driver (dma/neon_dma_gt32u2086.c)"
    default y
    help
        GT32U2086 FTEL DMA: 8 channel, command register and 32-bit copy word.

config NEON_MDF_DRIVER_SPI
    bool "Compile SPI driver (spi/neon_spi_gt32u2086.c)"
    default y
    help
        HAL SPI master/slave: polling 8/16/24/32-bit, full-duplex, slave-select, timing, FIFO,
        interrupt-status, clock-failure and DMA communication configuration. Pinmux that board
        configuration before transmission.

config NEON_MDF_DRIVER_PWM
    bool "Compile PWM driver (pwm/neon_pwm_gt32u2086.c)"
    default y
    help
        Report includes two-channel PWM GT32U2086 v8 DTI drivers (NEON_PWM_Init/Start/Stop/SetPeriod/SetPulse),
        following the PWM DTI register map selected by GT32U2086 v8 VP.

config NEON_MDF_DRIVER_TIM
    bool "Compile the TIM driver (tim/neon_tim_gt32u2086.c)"
    default y
    help
        report including full Timer driver for two channels CH0/CH1: configuration counter,
        prescaler/reload, compare, update/preload/one-pulse/center-aligned,
        interrupt/flag and clock-failure status. Bitfield and background logic taken from GT32U2086 LL; public API
        checks parameters and returns NEON_StatusTypeDef.

config NEON_MDF_DRIVER_RTC
    bool "Compile RTC driver (rtc/neon_rtc_gt32u2086.c)"
    default y
    help
        Report includes RTC driver (NEON_RTC_Init/SetTime/GetTime/SetDate/GetDate) - Init/DeInit port real
        from src_gt32u2086/gt32u2086_dti_rtc.c, Set/GetTime/Date write new pairing inline helper BCD real in
        header.

config NEON_MDF_DRIVER_TRNG
    bool "Compile TRNG driver (trng/neon_trng_gt32u2086.c)"
    default y
    help
        Report included driver TRNG (NEON_TRNG_Init/GetRandomNumber) - Init/DeInit port real from
        src_gt32u2086/gt32u2086_dti_trng.c, GetRandomNumber write new pairing inline helper real in header. 3rd
        IP (Dolphin Technology).

config NEON_MDF_DRIVER_AES
    bool "Compile AES driver (aes/neon_aes_gt32u2086.c)"
    default y
    help
        GT32U2086 AES-128: ECB/CBC/CTR, key/IV and polling READY/DONE.

config NEON_MDF_DRIVER_QSPI
    bool "Compile QSPI driver"
    default y
    help
        GT32U2086 QSPI SDR: Single/Dual/Quad command phases, FIFO polling,
        transfer completion, abort and memory-mapped reads.
        Flash erase/program, QE and status commands are supplied by the application.
        Automatic status-polling, DDR and DMA APIs are not implemented.

config NEON_MDF_DRIVER_WDT
    bool "Compile watchdog driver (wdt/neon_wdt_gt32u2086.c)"
    default y
    help
        GT32U2086 watchdog: timeout range, reset/interrupt response, refresh,
        read counter and acknowledge interrupt.

endmenu
